# Omni-Changeling: "any creature on the battlefield" includes an opponent's creature (a choice, not a target, CR 608.2d), and the
# copied creature's "enters" ability triggers (the ruling: "any enters abilities of the copied creature will trigger when
# Omni-Changeling enters"). Bot2's Steamcore Scholar is on the battlefield on turn 2; on turn 3 Bot1 convokes three Ornithopters and
# enters as a copy of it: a 2/2 Steamcore Scholar with flying, vigilance and changeling that draws two cards and then discards two
# (no instant, sorcery or flying creature card in hand, so no choice offered). The copy is Bot1's, the original stays Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Omni-Changeling
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Steamcore Scholar
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Steamcore Scholar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Plains; Plains)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Omni-Changeling.Cast(Convoke: Ornithopter, Ornithopter, Ornithopter)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar.Keywords = Changeling; Flying; Vigilance
Bot1.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar.Subtypes = (every creature type)
Bot2.Battlefield.Steamcore Scholar.Subtypes = Detective; Weird
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Island
Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
